12
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,610
That's really nice.

13
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:53,770
I love DIY because I find I'm good at it.

14
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:57,450
Doing DIY brings me great joy.
